  "description": "The story of a puppy who thinks he is a human being like his owner! Won Bin, a puppy who loves his owner more than anyone else, lives his life as a human being, Won Bin! The successful debut of the first dog at school! The scent of a male wafting through the air at a time when everything is perfect, including the love of his single-minded owner, Hyo-yeon! A love interest appears in the perfect love?! Can Won Bin keep his love for his owner...? This is a sweet and cute story about a cute puppy finding the definition of love.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/challenge/list?titleId=815129)",
